t part of the ABI)\n\n| symbol | gate | purpose |\n|--------|------|---------|\n| `__difftest_predict` | `#[cfg(feature = \"difftest\")]` | dispatch to any of the 15 internal predictors |\n| `__difftest_getpredict_index` | `#[cfg(feature = \"difftest\")]` | report which predictor `BTAC1C2_GetPredictFunc` selected |\n\nThese are additions to the Rust side only (C symbols ⊆ Rust symbols), so symbol\nparity in the required direction still holds. Under default features the Rust\n`.so` exports `get_predict_func` and nothing else — an exact match for C.\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1394,"cache_read_input_tokens":41829,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1394,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9cc3d074-7e08-4b72-9c53-7efe80847659","uuid":"004647e2-2e6c-4831-9101-8278dd1b20e9","timestamp":"2026-08-27T09:00:37.807Z"}
